<title>USA: Omaha hogs steady to off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs steady to off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were steady to off $0.50. Top $58.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>   US 1-3    230-260 lbs    57.75-58.00</p>
<p>   US 2-3    260-280 lbs    56.75-57.25</p>
<p>Sows: 25 percent. Steady.</p>
<p>   US 1-3    350-450 lbs    47.50-48.00</p>
<p>		 450-500 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>   US 2-3    500-700 lbs    52.00-52.50</p>
</text>
